01:52:38,877 --> 01:52:40,993
<i>and found the freedom
that they need.</i>

2028
01:52:41,088 --> 01:52:44,922
<i>Nathan said, "I don't know how I
am gonna do this speech about love."</i>

2029
01:52:45,008 --> 01:52:47,340
<i>After the fact he said, "I
was a little worried about it.</i>

2030
01:52:47,386 --> 01:52:50,720
<i>"It sounded maybe</i> a <i>little bit
hokey. " He said, "I got on set."</i>

2031
01:52:50,806 --> 01:52:53,047
<i>He said, "I turned. I
looked into those two eyes."</i>

2032
01:52:53,141 --> 01:52:56,179
<i>He said, "And that's where
that speech came from."</i>

2033
01:52:56,270 --> 01:53:00,389
<i>Because the energy he got
off Summer, just staring at her</i>

2034
01:53:01,191 --> 01:53:03,023
<i>gave him that speech.</i>

2035
01:53:03,318 --> 01:53:05,730
<i>That's why I love
this crew so much.</i>

2036
01:53:05,821 --> 01:53:09,280
<i>The way they work off each
other and with each other.</i>

2037
01:53:10,242 --> 01:53:13,030
<i>They were a family.
This was a home.</i>

2038
01:53:13,078 --> 01:53:17,037
<i>Maybe the kind that
as I constantly restate</i>

2039
01:53:17,666 --> 01:53:21,204
<i>is falling apart,
but it's a home nonetheless.</i>

2040
01:53:21,712 --> 01:53:23,749
<i>I'm done talking.
Watch the credits.</i>
